  "function": {
    "description": "Present a CheckInCard with one-off, recurring, free-time, and routine outcomes for an unclassified gap capture. Use when the user has described an activity during an unclassified gap and the classification is not yet clear. The `activity` is the user's free-form description. After this tool, wait for the user to choose one of the four options and then call the matching capture tool in the next turn.",
